# Fallback for the API key; the value saved in Settings wins if both are set.
OPENAI_API_KEY=
# Express port (the Vite dev server proxies /graphql here; agents reach /mcp directly).
PORT=8787
# SQLite file. A postgres:// URL is the seam for the pg swap (see server/db/client.ts).
DATABASE_URL=file:./data/tasks.db
